.TH "YAMLR-SUBSCRIBE" "1" "November 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBYamlr Pro Subscription & License Management\fR
.PP
The \fByamlr subscribe\fR command opens the secure upgrade portal to manage or activate a Yamlr Pro / Enterprise workspace subscription.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.RS
yamlr subscribe
.RE
.fi
---
.PP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Yamlr Core (\fBscan\fR, \fBdiff\fR, \fBfmt\fR, \fBcatalog\fR, \fBdoctor\fR) is 100% free and unlimited forever.
.PP
Yamlr Pro unlocks advanced capabilities:
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  Multi-resource automated relational repairs (\fByamlr heal --apply\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  Fleet-wide GitOps Pull Request batching (\fByamlr fleet\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  Cryptographic manifest signing & verification (\fByamlr sign\fR, \fByamlr verify\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  Cross-resource topological blast radius analysis (\fByamlr graph\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  Floating team licenses for CI/CD runners and platform engineering teams.
Once you obtain your license key, activate it instantly on any workstation or air-gapped CI runner with:
.PP
.nf
.RS
yamlr auth activate <LICENSE_KEY>
.RE
.fi
Team entitlement renewal does not contact a licensing service by default. To opt in to automatic renewal before a Team token expires, set \fBYAMLR_LICENSE_AUTO_RENEW=1\fR. The renewal request sends the stored signed entitlement token to the HTTPS licensing gateway. You can override the gateway origin with \fBYAMLR_LICENSE_GATEWAY_URL\fR. Without automatic renewal, activate a renewed token explicitly before the current token expires.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.nf
.RS
# Open the Pro subscription portal
yamlr subscribe
.RE
.fi
